WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.440 --> 00:00:03.656
Lesson fourteen. Safety Rules!

2
00:00:04.577 --> 00:00:11.661
Hello, hello! Hello, hello! Wave your hand, and say hello! Hello!

3
00:00:12.661 --> 00:00:15.374
Coco, what do we learn today?

4
00:00:15.424 --> 00:00:18.883
Today we learn: Safety Rules! Let's go!

5
00:00:19.655 --> 00:00:24.605
Look both ways! Say it with me. Look both ways!

6
00:00:28.517 --> 00:00:32.283
Traffic light! Say it with me. Traffic light!

7
00:00:36.343 --> 00:00:39.693
Helmet! Say it with me. Helmet!

8
00:00:43.647 --> 00:00:47.397
Seatbelt! Say it with me. Seatbelt!

9
00:00:51.439 --> 00:00:55.239
Danger! Say it with me. Danger!

10
00:00:59.215 --> 00:01:02.915
Careful! Say it with me. Careful!

11
00:01:06.989 --> 00:01:10.255
Stop! Say it with me. Stop!

12
00:01:14.147 --> 00:01:17.514
Safe! Say it with me. Safe!

13
00:01:21.564 --> 00:01:26.924
Listen. You should always look both ways.

14
00:01:26.974 --> 00:01:30.834
Say it with me. You should always look both ways.

15
00:01:35.848 --> 00:01:42.137
Always look both ways and wait for the traffic light before crossing. Wear your helmet to stay safe.

16
00:01:42.187 --> 00:01:43.469
I like this story!

17
00:01:44.498 --> 00:01:49.772
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:49.822 --> 00:01:50.972
Helmet!

19
00:01:51.856 --> 00:01:57.274
Look! What's the word?

20
00:01:57.324 --> 00:01:58.474
Careful!

21
00:01:59.396 --> 00:02:05.216
Value corner: Perseverance. Trying again after a mistake helps us learn and grow.

22
00:02:05.266 --> 00:02:07.242
I can show perseverance too!

23
00:02:07.999 --> 00:02:15.662
Bye-bye, bye-bye! See you soon! Wave your hand. Bye-bye, bye-bye!

24
00:02:15.712 --> 00:02:17.516
Bye-bye, friends!

